  # package, not in this repository. compose bind-mounts ./site into the portal,
  # so an absent or empty directory is not merely empty: nginx has no index to
  # serve, answers 403, fails its healthcheck, and Lab 1.1's portal assertion
  # fails on a stack that is otherwise perfectly healthy.
